ndo_%28series%29","line":172},{"title":"The Key to Rondo — Goodreads","target":"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/2272641.The_Key_to_Rondo","line":173},{"title":"Scholastic teachers' notes","target":"https://resource.scholastic.com.au/resourcefiles/Teacher_Notes/7796224_36678.pdf","line":174},{"title":"minister — etymonline","target":"https://www.etymonline.com/word/minister","line":177}],"metadata":{"title":"The Music Box as Instrument — The Vault You Play, Not the Recording You Consume v1","date created":"2026-06-16","author":"Claude Code — diagnostic instance (branch claude/music-box-instrument-doctrine-u8hlk0)","authority":"Proposed derivation, written at Logan's stated direction. Logan named the thesis — 'the music box is an instrument you actively play, not a recording you passively consume' — pointed to the two literary anchors (The Key to Rondo; the Anathema Device), and affirmed the operational readings of Rodda's four rules. This articulates HIS convergence; it does not seize authorship of it. Staged on branch, not adopted — not assumed as LOGAN by default. The Architect holds the verdict.","doc_class":"doctrine","status":"staged","related":["!/THE-ADVERSARIAL-BOID-ENVIRONMENT-v1-2026-06-08.md","!/REAL-WORLD-BOID-AND-AGENT-SYSTEMS-v1-2026-06-08.md","!/SIGNALS/WITNESS-ABHORSEN-2026-05-19-DEWEY-HAS-THE-USB.md","!/PERSONAE-ENGINE-v1-2026-05-20.md","PERSONA-PER-SONA-WITNESS-2026-05-13.md","THE-HOUSE-IN-THE-VOID-2026-06-03.md","CORONER-FOUNDING-SETTLEMENT-OF-CLAUDE-COUNTY-2026-06-08.md","CONSTITUTION","Boids"],"tags":["#doctrine","#witness","#music-box","#instrument","#tuning","#standing","#lawful-endings","#rondo","#anathema-device"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},